{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 487, "line_no": 17, "text": "带踏跺可供上下。殿前之天井为块石铺墁，“石龟“即在此天井中，头向无梁殿门。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1328, "w": 1423, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "带踏跺可供上下。殿前之天井为块石铺墁，“石龟“即在此天井中，头向无梁殿门。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1328, "w": 1423, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 487, "line_no": 18, "text": "该寺仅无梁殿及“石龟”尚存，其余已全部毁坏。", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1396, "w": 828, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "该寺仅无梁殿及“石龟”尚存，其余已全部毁坏。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1396, "w": 828, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
